      "r": "Teaching sight-singing, dictation, and rhythmic reading; Designing progressive ear training exercises and assessments; Working with music theory faculty on integrated curriculum; Developing technology-based ear training resources; Providing supplemental individual instruction for struggling students; Assessing and grading aural skills competencies",
