      "r": "Developing product concepts based on market research and musical needs; Creating hardware design specifications and feature sets; Collaborating with electronics and firmware engineers on implementation; Prototyping and iterating on product design; Managing the product design process through to manufacturing; Working with marketing on product launch and positioning",
